{"text":"kuruntokai","n":221,"lines":["அவரோ வாரார் முல்லையும் பூத்தன","பறியுடைக் கையர் மறியினத் தொழியப்","பாலொடு வந்து கூழொடு பெயரும்","யாடுடை இடைமகன் சென்னிச்","சூடிய வெல்லாம் சிறுபசு முகையே"],"tr":["avarō vārār mullaiyum pūttaṉa","paṟiyuṭaik kaiyar maṟiyiṉat toḻiyap","pāloṭu vantu kūḻoṭu peyarum","yāṭuṭai iṭaimakaṉ ceṉṉic","cūṭiya vellām ciṟupacu mukaiyē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"mullai","tinai_ta":"முல்லை","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"உறையூர் முதுகொற்றனார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Uṟaiyūr Mutukoṟṟaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 18, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 11, veṇṭaḷai 7"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"அவரோ","tr":"avarō","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அவ","tr":"ava"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரோ","tr":"rō"}]},{"text":"வாரார்","tr":"vārār","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரார்","tr":"rār"}]},{"text":"முல்லையும்","tr":"mullaiyum","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"முல்","tr":"mul"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]},{"text":"பூத்தன","tr":"pūttaṉa","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பூத்","tr":"pūt"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தன","tr":"taṉa"}]}],[{"text":"பறியுடைக்","tr":"paṟiyuṭaik","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பறி","tr":"paṟi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யுடைக்","tr":"yuṭaik"}]},{"text":"கையர்","tr":"kaiyar","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கை","tr":"kai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யர்","tr":"yar"}]},{"text":"மறியினத்","tr":"maṟiyiṉat","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மறி","tr":"maṟi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யினத்","tr":"yiṉat"}]},{"text":"தொழியப்","tr":"toḻiyap","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தொழி","tr":"toḻi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யப்","tr":"yap"}]}],[{"text":"பாலொடு","tr":"pāloṭu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பா","tr":"pā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லொடு","tr":"loṭu"}]},{"text":"வந்து","tr":"vantu","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வந்","tr":"van"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]},{"text":"கூழொடு","tr":"kūḻoṭu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூ","tr":"kū"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ழொடு","tr":"ḻoṭu"}]},{"text":"பெயரும்","tr":"peyarum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெய","tr":"peya"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரும்","tr":"rum"}]}],[{"text":"யாடுடை","tr":"yāṭuṭai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டுடை","tr":"ṭuṭai"}]},{"text":"இடைமகன்","tr":"iṭaimakaṉ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இடை","tr":"iṭai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மகன்","tr":"makaṉ"}]},{"text":"சென்னிச்","tr":"ceṉṉic","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சென்","tr":"ceṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னிச்","tr":"ṉic"}]}],[{"text":"சூடிய","tr":"cūṭiya","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சூ","tr":"cū"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டிய","tr":"ṭiya"}]},{"text":"வெல்லாம்","tr":"vellām","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெல்","tr":"vel"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லாம்","tr":"lām"}]},{"text":"சிறுபசு","tr":"ciṟupacu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிறு","tr":"ciṟu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பசு","tr":"pacu"}]},{"text":"முகையே","tr":"mukaiyē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முகை","tr":"mukai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யே","tr":"yē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"அவரோ","parts":[{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"அவர்","gloss":"he (honorific)"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"he indeed"},{"surface":"வாரார்","parts":[{"text":"வாரார்","lemma":"வருதல்","gloss":"does not come"}],"gloss":"he does not come"},{"surface":"முல்லையும்","parts":[{"text":"முல்லை","lemma":"முல்லை","gloss":"wild jasmine"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and the wild jasmine"},{"surface":"பூத்தன","parts":[{"text":"பூ","lemma":"பூ","gloss":"blossom"},{"text":"த்தன","lemma":"பூத்தன","gloss":"have blossomed"}],"gloss":"have blossomed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பறியுடை","parts":[{"text":"பறி","lemma":"பறி","gloss":"leaf-basket"},{"text":"உடை","lemma":"உடை","gloss":"possessing"}],"gloss":"possessing a leaf-basket"},{"surface":"கையர்","parts":[{"text":"கை","lemma":"கை","gloss":"hand"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"they (who have)"}],"gloss":"those with hands"},{"surface":"மறியினத்து","parts":[{"text":"மறி","lemma":"மறி","gloss":"lamb"},{"text":"இனத்து","lemma":"இனம்","gloss":"of the herd"}],"gloss":"with the herd of lambs"},{"surface":"ஒழிய","parts":[{"text":"ஒழிய","lemma":"ஒழிதல்","gloss":"to stay behind"}],"gloss":"to stay behind"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பாலொடு","parts":[{"text":"பால்","lemma":"பால்","gloss":"milk"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with milk"},{"surface":"வந்து","parts":[{"text":"வந்து","lemma":"வருதல்","gloss":"having come"}],"gloss":"having come"},{"surface":"கூழொடு","parts":[{"text":"கூழ்","lemma":"கூழ்","gloss":"porridge"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with porridge"},{"surface":"பெயரும்","parts":[{"text":"பெயரும்","lemma":"பெயர்தல்","gloss":"who returns"}],"gloss":"who returns"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யாடுடை","parts":[{"text":"யாடு","lemma":"யாடு","gloss":"sheep"},{"text":"உடை","lemma":"உடை","gloss":"possessing"}],"gloss":"possessing sheep"},{"surface":"இடைமகன்","parts":[{"text":"இடைமகன்","lemma":"இடைமகன்","gloss":"shepherd youth"}],"gloss":"shepherd youth"},{"surface":"சென்னி","parts":[{"text":"சென்னி","lemma":"சென்னி","gloss":"head"}],"gloss":"head"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சூடிய","parts":[{"text":"சூடிய","lemma":"சூடுதல்","gloss":"worn"}],"gloss":"worn"},{"surface":"வெல்லாம்","parts":[{"text":"வெல்லாம்","lemma":"வெல்லாம்","gloss":"all"}],"gloss":"all","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சிறுபசு","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"சிறுமை","gloss":"small"},{"text":"பசு","lemma":"பசுமை","gloss":"fresh/green"}],"gloss":"small and fresh"},{"surface":"முகையே","parts":[{"text":"முகை","lemma":"முகை","gloss":"bud"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"are indeed buds"}]}],"literal":"He indeed has not come, and the wild jasmine has blossomed / With leaf-baskets in hands, leaving behind the herd of lambs / having come with milk and returning with porridge / the sheep-owning shepherd youth's head / worn all are indeed small fresh buds.","translation":"He has not returned, yet the wild jasmine has blossomed. On the head of the young shepherd who owns sheep, who leaves the herd of lambs behind, comes to the village with milk, and returns with porridge, holding a leaf-basket in his hand, all the flowers he has worn are small, fresh buds.","modern":"அவர் இன்னும் திரும்பி வரவில்லை; ஆனால் முல்லை மலர்கள் பூத்துவிட்டன. கையில் இலைக்கூடையை ஏந்தி, ஆட்டுக்குட்டிகளின் கூட்டத்தை மேய்ச்சல் நிலத்தில் விட்டுவிட்டு, கிராமத்திற்குப் பாலைக் கொண்டுவந்து கொடுத்துவிட்டு, அதற்குப் பதிலாகக் கூழைப் பெற்றுக்கொண்டு திரும்புகின்ற ஆடுகளை உடைய இடையனின் தலையில் சூடப்பட்டிருப்பவை எல்லாம் சிறிய, பசுமையான முல்லை அரும்புகளே ஆகும்.","explanation":"The heroine speaks to her companion during the rainy season, expressing her grief over the hero's delayed return. He had promised to return before the rains, but though the wild jasmine has started to bloom, he is not yet back. She points out a young shepherd who has come to the village to barter milk for grain. On his head, he wears a wreath of jasmine flowers, which are still small, fresh buds. This image of the buds suggests that the season has just commenced, offering a faint hope while intensifying her longing. The poem beautifully captures the Mullai landscape with its pastoral elements like the shepherd, sheep, milk, and jasmine buds.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.9],[0.9,1.2],[1.2,1.9],[1.9,2.7],[2.7,2.8],[2.8,3.46],[3.51,3.69],[3.69,3.74],[3.8,4.9],[4.9,5.1],[5.1,5.2],[5.2,6.14],[6.3,6.7],[6.7,7.1],[7.1,8.2],[8.2,8.3],[8.3,8.75],[8.75,9.2]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.3,2.0],[2.0,3.2],[3.2,3.2],[3.2,4.2],[4.4,5.0],[5.0,5.2],[5.4,5.8],[5.8,6.2],[6.2,6.3],[6.3,7.41],[7.6,8.1],[8.1,8.6],[8.6,9.8],[9.8,9.9],[9.9,10.7],[10.7,11.1]]}}